This repository includes code derived from the following third-party work:

samples/csharp/PerchlightKeys/Ed25519.cs
  Ed25519 signature verification, ported to C# from TweetNaCl version
  20140427 (https://tweetnacl.cr.yp.to/) by Daniel J. Bernstein, Bernard van
  Gastel, Wesley Janssen, Tanja Lange, Peter Schwabe and Sjaak Smetsers.
  TweetNaCl is in the public domain. The port keeps TweetNaCl's arithmetic
  function by function; it adds an S < L check (RFC 8032 section 5.1.7) and
  uses .NET's SHA-512.

src/lib/mail/resend.js, src/lib/mail/common.js
  Copied from perchlight-list (same author, MIT).

samples/vectors/rfc8032.json
  Includes the test vectors of RFC 8032 section 7.1 (IETF; test keys only).
